---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Skill Foundry" description="Privacy information for visitors to Skill Foundry.">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>This page explains the general privacy approach for the Skill Foundry website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow article-content">
      <h2>Information received through the website</h2>
      <p>Skill Foundry is currently a public resource website. The site does not currently require visitors to create an account or submit payment details.</p>
      <p>Like most websites, requests may include standard technical information handled by the hosting infrastructure, such as an IP address, browser information and request details. This information may be processed to deliver, secure and maintain the website.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>The current site does not intentionally use advertising cookies or third-party tracking for personalized advertising. If analytics, forms, accounts or other data-collection features are added later, this policy will be updated to describe them.</p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>Some resources may link to third-party platforms such as video or AI tools. Those services have their own privacy policies and practices, which are outside Skill Foundry's control.</p>

      <h2>Updates</h2>
      <p>This policy may be updated as the website changes. The version published on this page is the one that applies to the current site.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
